<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Nike.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Nike.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist raised FY97 estimate to $2.80/shr from $2.55/shr and increased FY98 estimate to $3.35/shr from $3.04.</p>
<p>--Cited stronger-than-expected Q2 results released Wednesday and 54 pct rise in future orders.</p>
<p>Nike up 5-7/8 to 61.</p>
</text>
